+DOT OIG CC-2006-085 says it did not find evidence to conclude knowing falsehood, purposeful omission or intentional failure to correct concerning hijacking notifications. It also calls unreasonable the explanation that officials lacked an accurate UA93 notification time when they possessed a log/transcript showing10:07.
