+<a id="m166"></a>
+### M166 — DOT reports executives knew a liaison answer was inaccurate and did not correct it
+
+**Original ID:** FA003. **Type:** Affirmative oversight finding of knowledge plus noncorrection.
+
+The QFR claimed the Air Force liaison immediately joined the bridge after08:46. OIG says she joined only after09:37, that three executives learned the answer was inaccurate, and none corrected it with the Commission.
